{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56540","headline":"还丹歌 九 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹砂丹砂，济命济家。\n能济我命，能济我家。\n能生姹女，嫁与黄芽。\n事夫洁素，无喜无怒。\n礼乐周旋，晨昏节度。\n金亦可作，世亦可度。\n作今不成，徒然自悮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}